@startuml 유명인_궁합보기

autonumber

actor User as U
participant FlutterApp as F
participant "CelebrityController\n(Flask API)" as CCT
participant "CelebrityService" as CS
participant "CelebrityRepository" as CR
participant "SajuCalculator" as SC
database DB

U -> F: 유명인과 궁합 보기
F -> CCT: GET /celebrities?keyword=
CCT -> CS: list_celebrities(keyword)
CS -> CR: list(keyword)
CR -> DB: SELECT celebrities WHERE keyword LIKE ...
DB --> CR: list
CR --> CS: celebrity list
CS -> CS: _celebrity_summary() - 각 유명인 정보 요약
CS --> CCT: list
CCT --> F: 200 {items: [...], count: N}
F --> U: 유명인 목록 표시

U -> F: 특정 유명인 선택
F -> CCT: POST /celebrities/{id}/compatibility {saju, gender}
CCT -> CS: calculate_with_celebrity(user_saju, celebrity_id, user_gender, use_ai)
CS -> CS: _require_celebrity(celebrity_id)
CS -> CR: get_by_id(celebrity_id)
CR -> DB: SELECT celebrity WHERE celebrity_id = ?
DB --> CR: celebrity record
CR --> CS: Celebrity 객체
CS -> CS: _celebrity_summary(celebrity) - 오행 계산 포함
CS -> SC: calculate_compatibility(user_saju, celeb.saju, user_gender, celeb.gender)
SC --> CS: {original, final, stress}
CS -> CS: _describe(final_score) - 기본 설명 생성
alt AI 인사이트 생성 (use_ai=True)
  CS -> CS: Gemini API 호출 - 카테고리별 인사이트 생성
  CS --> CS: insights {연애, 우정, 직장}
end
CS -> CS: _get_element_relationship() - 오행 관계 설명
CS --> CCT: {celebrity, scores, description, insights, element_relationship}
CCT --> F: 200 result
F --> U: 결과 표시

@enduml

